<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About – Samikshya Shrestha</title>
  <meta name="description" content="About Samikshya Shrestha – CS undergraduate focused on Data Science, AI, and full-stack web development." />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg:#0c0c10; --card:#16161d; --card-hover:#1c1c25;
      --text:#ececec; --sub:#b0b0b8; --muted:#6b6b78;
      --accent:#a78bfa; --accent2:#818cf8;
      --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }
    *,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
    body{
      font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
      background:var(--bg);
      color:var(--text);
      line-height:1.6;
      background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 40% at 50% -10%,rgba(167,139,250,0.10) 0%,transparent 70%);
    }
    .container{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:0 2rem;}

    /* NAV */
    header{padding:2rem 0;}
    nav{display:flex;justify-content:center;}
    .nav-container{
      display:flex;padding:0.55rem 1.6rem;border-radius:50px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid var(--border);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    }
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;}
    .nav-links a{
      text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.88rem;
      letter-spacing:0.02em;position:relative;padding-bottom:4px;transition:color 0.25s;
    }
    .nav-links a::after{
      content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:0%;height:2px;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));
      border-radius:2px;transition:width 0.3s ease;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.active{color:var(--text);}
    .nav-links a:hover::after,.nav-links a.active::after{width:100%;}
    .nav-links a.active{font-weight:600;}

    /* PAGE */
    main{padding:3.5rem 0 6rem;}
    .page-badge{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;
      background:rgba(167,139,250,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.22);
      color:var(--accent);padding:0.28rem 0.9rem;border-radius:50px;
      font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;
      text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1rem;
    }
    h1{
      font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,2.8rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 30%,var(--accent) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
      background-clip:text;margin-bottom:0.9rem;
    }
    .intro{color:var(--sub);max-width:600px;font-size:0.97rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:2.4rem;}

    /* LAYOUT */
    .about-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 0.6fr;gap:3rem;align-items:start;}

    /* CARDS */
    .card{
      background:var(--card);
      background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 0%,transparent 60%);
      border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;
      padding:1.6rem 1.8rem;margin-bottom:1.2rem;
      transition:background 0.3s,box-shadow 0.3s,transform 0.3s;
    }
    .card:hover{
      background:var(--card-hover);transform:translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.45),0 0 0 1px rgba(167,139,250,0.18),0 0 30px rgba(167,139,250,0.07);
    }
    .card-title{
      font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;
      text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:0.75rem;
    }
    .card-content{font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--sub);line-height:1.75;}

    /* PROFILE */
    .profile{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;}
    .profile-wrap{
      position:relative;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;
      box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.28),0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.48),0 0 0 1px var(--border);
      transition:box-shadow 0.4s ease;
    }
    .profile-wrap::before{
      content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(167,139,250,0.08) 0%,transparent 60%);
      border-radius:20px;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;
    }
    .profile-wrap:hover{
      box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.32),0 20px 56px rgba(0,0,0,0.52),
        0 0 0 1px rgba(167,139,250,0.28),0 0 48px rgba(167,139,250,0.10);
    }
    .profile-wrap img{
      width:260px;display:block;border-radius:20px;object-fit:cover;
      filter:grayscale(100%);opacity:0.88;
      transition:filter 0.5s ease,transform 0.5s ease,opacity 0.4s ease;
    }
    .profile-wrap:hover img{filter:grayscale(0%);transform:scale(1.03);opacity:1;}

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media(max-width:768px){
      .about-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .profile{justify-content:center;margin-top:2rem;}
      .profile-wrap img{width:220px;}
    }
    @media(max-width:480px){h1{font-size:2rem;}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <header>
    <nav>
      <div class="nav-container">
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/projects">Projects</a>
          <a href="/about" class="active">About</a>
          <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <span class="page-badge">✦ About Me</span>
    <h1>Get to know me</h1>

    <div class="about-section">
      <div>
        <p class="intro">
          I am a Computer Science undergraduate focused on Data Science and Artificial Intelligence.
          I enjoy building practical systems using web development, AI integration, and data analysis
          to solve real-world problems.
        </p>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">What I do</div>
          <div class="card-content">
            Build full-stack web applications<br />
            Develop AI chatbot systems<br />
            Work on data analysis &amp; visualization<br />
            Design clean, user-focused interfaces
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">Skills</div>
          <div class="card-content">
            Python, SQL, R, Java (basic)<br />
            Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib<br />
            Git, GitHub, Tableau, Jupyter<br />
            MySQL, MongoDB
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">Focus Areas</div>
          <div class="card-content">
            AI-powered systems &amp; chatbots<br />
            Web apps with real-world use cases<br />
            Data-driven insights &amp; visualization
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="profile">
        <div class="profile-wrap">
          <img src="/images/profile.png" alt="Samikshya Shrestha – profile photo" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

</div>
</body>
</html>